    "$$LATE = \\frac{E[Y_i | Z_i = 1] - E[Y_i | Z_i = 0]}{E[D_i | Z_i = 1] - E[D_i | Z_i = 0]} = \\frac{ITT}{\\text{compliance rate}}$$\n",
